# SPDX-License-Identifier: MIT
# Local (oriole): the two rear sensors are not usable yet, and apps tend to
# open the first back camera by default.
# - S5KGN1 (main): the C-PHY link never delivers a clean frame (CSIS
#   ERR_FS/ERR_FE, all-zero buffers).
# - IMX386 (ultrawide): streams, but the CSIS stops completing buffers
#   after ~40 frames.
# Keep them from binding so that only the working front IMX355 is
# offered. `modprobe s5kgn1` / `modprobe imx386` still loads them by hand.
blacklist s5kgn1
blacklist imx386
